### Connexion de démo : étudiant
# @name student
POST http://localhost:3000/auth/demo-login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "kind": "STUDENT", "id": 8 }

### Candidater avec un message
POST http://localhost:3000/applications
Authorization: {{student.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "offerId": 1,
  "message": "Le développement React m'intéresse particulièrement."
}

### Candidater sans message
POST http://localhost:3000/applications
Authorization: {{student.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "offerId": 3 }

### Consulter ses candidatures
GET http://localhost:3000/applications
Authorization: {{student.response.body.token}}

### Retirer une candidature en cours
DELETE http://localhost:3000/applications/7
Authorization: {{student.response.body.token}}
